      "text": "WHEREAS, in furtherance of this commitment and consistent with recommendations made by the New York City Commission on Homelessness established by the Mayor, and in an effort to provide assistance to the homeless in the most effective and efficient manner, the Mayor will propose legislation to create a new agency whose function will be to provide City services to homeless families and individuals, expedite the construction of transitional housing for the homeless, and transfer the operation of such housing to not-for-profit organizations, and",
